    <dataSetInformation>
      <common:UUID>105c300e-5c7f-4e9f-b583-e8ce5a175814</common:UUID>
      <name>
        <baseName xml:lang="en">Cast-iron raw casting, electric furnace, sand casting</baseName>
      </name>
      <classificationInformation>
        <common:classification name="ILCDCategories" classes="../ILCDClassification.xml">
          <common:class level="0">Materials production</common:class>
          <common:class level="1">Metals and semimetals</common:class>
        </common:classification>
      </classificationInformation>
      <common:generalComment>The dataset has been developed in LIFE EFFIGE project. Details are given in “PEFCR of Raw Casting”. In a cradle to gate approach, the dataset includes the all input and output for the production of 1 ton of cast iron raw casting through cupola furnace and green sand casting.</common:generalComment>
    </dataSetInformation>
    <quantitativeReference type="Reference flow(s)">
      <referenceToReferenceFlow>0</referenceToReferenceFlow>
    </quantitativeReference>
    <time>
      <common:referenceYear>2018</common:referenceYear>
      <common:dataSetValidUntil>2024</common:dataSetValidUntil>
    </time>
    <geography>
      <locationOfOperationSupplyOrProduction location="IT"/>
    </geography>
    <technology>
      <technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses>The dataset includes the model of the production 1 ton of cast iron raw casting with an electric furnace and sand casting.&#13;
Within the upstream processes, the following raw materials, auxiliary and chemicals for melting, moulding and casting are considered: Pig-iron production and supply, iron scrap supply, fluxing agents production and supply, refractory materials production and supply, silica sand production and supply, bentonite production and supply, coal dust production and supply, resins and catalyst production and supply.&#13;
Within the core processes, the following processes are considered: electricity consumption for melting, moulding, casting and others foundry activities (e.g. compressors, gas cleaning systems, etc.), natural gas consumption for melting, moulding, casting and others foundry activities (e.g. compressors, gas cleaning systems, etc.), coke consumption for melting, water consumption for melting, moulding and casting, air emissions for melting, moulding, casting and waste generation for melting, moulding, casting.&#13;
Downstream processes such as further finishing activities, distribution to customers, use phase and end-of-life treatment of used products are excluded.</technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses>
    </technology>
  </processInformation>
